      "text": "```python\nfrom qiskit import QuantumCircuit\nfrom qiskit.converters import circuit_to_dag\n\ncirc = QuantumCircuit(4, 4)\ncirc.h(0)\ncirc.h(1)\ncirc.h(2)\ncirc.h(3)\ncirc.cx(0, 1)\ncirc.cx(1, 2)\ncirc.cx(2, 3)\ncirc.rz(0.5, 0)\ncirc.measure(0, 0)\ncirc.measure(1, 1)\ncirc.measure(2, 2)\ncirc.measure(3, 3)\n\ndag = circuit_to_dag(circ)\n\ncounts = {}\n# FIX: iterated only over dag.longest_path(), which counts just the gates on one critical path -> changed to dag.op_nodes() so every operation node in the DAG is counted, because the question asks for the count of every gate in the circuit\nfor node in dag.op_nodes():\n    if node.type == \"op\":\n        counts[node.name] = counts.get(node.name, 0) + 1\n\nprint(counts)\n```",
